:: Fishing Beach Magnet Pull Cannonball
<<effects>>
The line goes taut and won't come up. Something heavy is stuck down there.
<br><br>

<<link [[Lean back and haul|Fishing Beach Magnet Pull Cannonball Haul]]>><</link>><<athleticsdifficulty 800 1500>>


:: Fishing Beach Magnet Pull Cannonball Haul
<<effects>>
<<if $athleticsSuccess>>
	A round iron cannonball <span class="green">rolls up through the sand</span> and thumps to a stop at your feet. Heavy, pitted with rust, but solid iron. It's probably worth something at the scrapyard.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push("cannonball")>>
	<<set $fishing.singleCatch.cannonball to true>>
<<else>>
	<span class="red">Whatever it is, it won't budge.</span> Your rope goes slack as the object slips free from the magnet.<<gtiredness>><<tiredness 1>>
<</if>>
<br><br>

<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>

:: Fishing Beach Magnet Scrap Catch
<<effects>>
<<if $daily.fishing.beach.fisher.phase is "fishing">>
	<<fishingBeachMagnetScrapCaughtFisher>>
<<else>>
	<<fishingBeachMagnetScrapCaught>>
<</if>>


:: Widgets Fishing Beach Magnet Catch [widget]
<<widget "fishingBeachMagnetScrapCaught">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away. You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap.type)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingBeach")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

<<widget "fishingBeachMagnetScrapCaughtFisher">>
	<<fishingMagnetCatchText $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	You pry it off the magnet and stow it away.
	<<set $scrapInventory.push($fishingMagnetScrap.type)>>
	<<run decrementMagnetLoot("fishingBeach")>>
	<<unset $fishingMagnetScrap>>
	<<if !$daily.fishing.scrapComment>>
		<<set $daily.fishing.scrapComment to true>>
		<br><br>
		<<loadNPC 0 "fishing_beach_npc_fisher">><<person1>>
		The <<personsimple>> nods at what you've pulled up. "That's worth something. Scrapyard'd give you a bit for scrap like that."
	<<else>>
		You might be able to sell it for scrap.
	<</if>>
	<br><br>

	<<link [[Next|Fishing Beach Wait]]>><</link>>
<</widget>>

